# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Per-sprint validation scratch, probes, backups, caches — REGENERABLE.
# Never deploy/commit. Real sprint source is committed EXPLICITLY (Rule #32:
# never `git add -A`). Families confirmed scratch as of Sprint 2.22.0a.19
# (git hygiene — the +76k untracked "Create PR" noise was all of this).
# Does NOT ignore: README*, CHANGELOG_v*.md, HOTFIX_NOTE.txt, docs/, backtest/,
# or the REQUIRED committed sqlites (developer_inventory / building_age_cache /
# cap_rates) — those stay tracked.
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Leading-dot sprint scratch (probes / smoke / baselines / latency / recon)
.a[0-9]*_*
.a[0-9]*drift*
.base_*
.checks_*
.hlat_*
.kickoff_*
.live_*
.m2_*
.postdeploy_*
.probe_*
.r9_*
.sm_*
.smoke_*
.verify_*
.vi_*
.wf_*

# Leading-underscore scratch harnesses / dirs
_r9_*
_audit_*
_c1_*

# Probe / audit / recon scratch (file-based throwaway per Rule #34)
probe_*.py
probe_*.json
recon_*.py
measure_*.py
audit_*.log
audit_*.json
audit_*.txt

# One-off JSON dumps / smoke output / regression logs
out.json
test.json
test_compound.json
test_investor.json
test_mam.json
smoke_live_*.json
sprint_*_regression.log

# Editor/backup snapshots (root .gitignore covers *.bak_* ; these are *.bak / *.bakN)
*.bak
*.bak[0-9]*

# Pre-sprint full-tree backup snapshots (git IS the backup; never commit)
backup_before_*/

# Microsoft Office temp / owner-lock files (created when a .docx/.md is opened in Word)
~$*

# Archives + local regenerable caches (NOT the required tracked sqlites)
*.zip
t2_listings_cache.sqlite
moj_weekly.db
